                                "sense_id": "797783ba-ef20-3554-a9e7-ec6196b42102",
                                "text": "The prerogative of God extendeth as well to the reason as to the will of man ; so that as we are to obey his law though we find a reluctation in our will , so we are to believe his word"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
